      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Rules:


    Hit Play to select level.

    When lights, water faucets,
    or showers turn on; run to the object to earn points.

    If you take too long
    to turn off the items you will lose points.

    Fill up the progress bar before
    the timer runs out in order to pass the level.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
